    "LOCAL_HEALTH_ACCEPTED is an explicit local decision, not remote deployment success or full device health acceptance.",
    "Real system installation, package replacement and relaunch, AndroidKeyStore survival, power loss, vendor interaction and complete post-update control require separate evidence.",
    "Broker connectivity and actual authorized app launches are not exercised by the local health inspector; successful discovery only proves its bounded read path.",
    "COMMITTING and PENDING_USER remain blocking without the original system success receipt; current package facts alone do not settle unknown commits.",
    "The process guard combines compile-time version with Context loaded paths and protected PackageManager source files. It does not claim protection against root or a compromised system.",
    "The inspector reuses existing identity, complete continuity and current credential validators. Host tests of these paths do not prove hardware key continuity or live network behavior."
